//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano
//
// Builds the same design twice — object-linked and with
// ExternalFunction(inline=True) — checks both produce identical results, and
// reports each variant's latency.  inline=True is a Peano-only path (the Chess
// front-end cannot llvm-link), hence the `peano` requirement.
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/inline_kernel.py --iters 50 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: PASS!
